    m_MinSize: 10
    m_MaxSize: 40
    m_Alignment: 0
    m_AlignByGeometry: 0
    m_RichText: 1
    m_HorizontalOverflow: 0
    m_VerticalOverflow: 0
    m_LineSpacing: 1.3
  m_Text: '<size=22><b>CASE FILE #1</b></size>

    <size=18><b>LEVEL 1: The Missing
    Necklace</b></size>


    <b>Lead Investigator:</b> Detective Kyle Gabriel Pastrana
    (Lead Field Detective)

    <b>Date & Location:</b> Stormy Evening - High-Society
    Manor Study

    <b>Victim:</b> Kirby Raymundo (Aristocrat - Proud & Demanding
    Owner)


    <size=16><b>[ INCIDENT SUMMARY ]</b></size>

    A valuable family
    necklace disappeared from the manor safe during a stormy evening gathering.


    <size=16><b>[
    CURRENT OBJECTIVE ]</b></size>

    Interrogate Vince Angelo Batecan, inspect
    table evidence, disprove his kitchen alibi, and uncover the truth.

'
